==Trivia==
*Chickful A is a play on the long-time American fast food restaurant [[wikipedia:Chick-fil-A|Chick-fil-A]]. The "A" may additionally stand for [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]], Chickful A's trait.
*Her Japanese name, ヒオコエル ''Hiokoeru'' (Hiokoel), is derived from 雛 ''hiyoko'' (chick), 怒る ''okoru'' (to get angry) and ''El'' (the Hebrew word for God, commonly used as a suffix in angel names). "El" carries over to [[Vendor El]], even though it's not an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]].
*The short-tempered grandmother mentioned in her Japanese description may be [[Cumulus Gallus]], who is described as ancestral and having a violent personality.
**In the Korean version, Chickful A's short temper came from her father instead.
*In [[Nyanko Defence Force|BCJP]], Chickful A and [[Zuche]], the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of her friend [[Duche]], are both chickens with aspirations of flying.

